  "notes": [
    "CAMPAIGN.md §7.1 / §12.2 '3-1'..'3-6' with the KI1 framings: E2a1 2880-3328 is framed at camY 48 (h 64-288) and E6a1 2848-3168 at camY 224 (h 240-464), where the original camera stood, so their 64-px lanes lie inside the clamp (at the §4.1 camY they were 48 and 32 px).",
    "KI2: the E2a1 far layer of a2 S5 reads the scroll3 block map past the declared 1536 px (x3 672-1856, the live maximum), as the game streams it.",
    "Section casts (CAMPAIGN §4.4 'cast', merged over the chapter pool): lighter A/BOMB/KNIFE variants where the ROM-affine HP budget of the chapter's waves exceeded ENEMIES §2.6 by more than 15% (tests/campaign.cjs (8)); ratio now 1.139.",
    "3-1: the CAMPAIGN's E6a0 dome-frame patch over the E5a0 sky was tried and dropped: the dome ribs share their 16-px cells with the opaque rock ceiling, so the patch reads as a rectangle; the dome is seen from 3-2 on.",
    "Not built: the 3-3 egg-rack chunks of CAMPAIGN §12.2 (E2a0's map has no nest or egg cells; the egg racks are left to props/sprites), and the 3-1 dome-frame patch (the E6a0 ribs share cells with opaque rock).",
    "Seams (CAMPAIGN §4.1 join chunks): every join that is not a mirror join is covered by a dome tree, the vine-wrapped foreground trunk of E2a0 (400-448, palette rows 5-7 lifted off the forest behind it), centred on the join.",
    "Far layer: one per section (the source with most columns in it): 3-1 E5a0, 3-2 E6a0, 3-3 E2a0, 3-4 E6a1, 3-5 E2a1 (streamed to 1856, KI2), 3-6 E6a1; it changes only behind a dome tree.",
    "Not built: the 3-3 egg-rack chunks of CAMPAIGN §12.2 (E2a0's map has no nest or egg cells; the egg racks are left to props/sprites), and the 3-1 dome-frame patch (the E6a0 ribs share cells with opaque rock)."
  ],
